Package: montyhall
Title: Simulate the Monty Hall Problem
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Graham",
           email = "jgraha27@asu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for simulating the Monty Hall problem.
    The package allows users to create games, select doors, open goat
    doors, stay with or switch selections, determine winners, and run
    repeated simulations to compare game strategies.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0),
    dplyr
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0